# 08 — 物理端

入口分 main / client（fmj）。按键 `26.1.2/develop_key-mappings`。Mixin `26.1.2/develop_mixins_bytecode`。
客户端渲染 `26.1.2/develop_rendering_basic-concepts`。不要在服务端调 `Minecraft.getInstance()`。

## Decision Flow

```
→ 逻辑 → main entrypoint
→ 渲染/按键/Screen → client entrypoint
→ Mixin → mixins_bytecode；deep 校验用 mixin_analyze
```
